{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36616","headline":"秋日禅智寺见裴郎中题名寄韦瞻 · 罗隐","name":"秋日禅智寺见裴郎中题名寄韦瞻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野寺疎钟万木秋，偶寻题处认名侯。\n官离南郡应闲暇，地胜东山想驻留。\n百醆浓醪成别梦，两行垂露澣羁愁。\n心知只有韦公在，更对真踪话旧游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}